@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊所负责人" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:审核费用调整与</u>\n<u>退费控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:费用申请</u>" as Request
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:应收账目</u>" as Bill
participant "<u>:费用调整</u>" as Adjustment
participant "<u>:调整项目</u>" as AdjustmentItem
participant "<u>:患者付款</u>" as Payment
participant "<u>:付款分配</u>" as Allocation
participant "工作单元" as W
participant "数据映射器" as DM
participant "权限与会话服务" as AUTH
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-25办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 办理(ctx, UC25Command)
activate K
group 本阶段同一写事务
K -> W : 开始写事务()
W --> K : 同一连接
K -> AUTH : 核对岗位及对象(ctx, 引用)
AUTH --> K : 有效授权依据或拒绝
K -> W : 核对提交(ctx, cmd)
W --> K : 新命令分支（原结果短路见公共图）
K -> DM : 装载(对象引用、连接)
DM --> K : 实体与依据快照
K -> Request : 核对待审核依据(负责人资格及原版本)
activate Request
Request --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Request
K -> Funds : 核对可处理额度(申请、未决办理)
activate Funds
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
opt 批准事项涉及应收及原分配调整
K -> Bill : 批准费用调整(同意范围及临床依据)
activate Bill
Bill -> Adjustment : 形成批准调整(原账目和申请)
activate Adjustment
Adjustment -> AdjustmentItem : 逐项保留调整(原应收项目及差额)
activate AdjustmentItem
AdjustmentItem --> Adjustment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate AdjustmentItem
Adjustment --> Bill : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Adjustment
Bill --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Bill
K -> Funds : 更正付款分配(调整后的应收及原分配)
activate Funds
Funds -> Payment : 调整已分配范围(保留原分配来源)
activate Payment
Payment -> Allocation : 追加分配更正(释放或重新分配金额)
activate Allocation
Allocation --> Payment : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Allocation
Payment --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Payment
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K -> Request : 保存审核结论(同意及可退范围)
activate Request
Request --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Request
alt 本阶段全部校验通过
K -> DM : 保存(变更集合、连接)
DM --> K : 保存成功或版本冲突
K -> W : 校验集合与来源()
W --> K : 末校验结果
K -> W : 保存结果与审计并提交()
else 任一步骤拒绝或保存失败
K -> W : 回滚()
end
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Allocation
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
